sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Writer thread
    participant BW as BatchWriter
    participant F as WriteFallback

    W->>BW: persist(batch of 500)
    BW--xW: failure
    Note over W,BW: retry the batch record by record
    loop every record
        W->>BW: persist(record)
        BW--xW: failure
        W->>F: handle(record)
    end
    Note over W,F: fallback failed too: ERROR log,<br/>record counted as lost
